{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kinkakuji",
  "chunk_id": "kinkakuji-chunk-0654",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "小督局因避忌乎清盛而隐身于嵯峨野，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Lady Kogo hid herself away in Sagano to avoid Kiyomori,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "源仲国奉敕命寻找，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and Minamoto no Nakakuni set out in search of her by imperial command,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他在中秋明月之夜循着隐约传来的琴声，找到了局的隐居住所。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "on the night of the mid-autumn full moon, he followed the faint sound of a koto drifting through the air and found the place where she was living in seclusion.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这首琴曲名叫《念夫恋》，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The koto piece was called Nenbu Koi,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "谣曲②《小督》里有这样一段唱词：\"明月当空夜，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and in the noh chant Kogo there is a passage like this: \"On a night when the bright moon hangs in the sky,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "拜谒法轮寺，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I paid a visit to Horin-ji Temple,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "忽闻悠扬的琴声，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and suddenly heard the lingering sound of a koto,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "疑是山上暴风雨或松涛声，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "wondering whether it was a storm on the mountain or the sound of wind in the pines,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "却原来是被寻人的琴鸣，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but it was in fact the koto of the very person I sought,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "想听听是什么乐曲，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and when I wished to hear what piece it was,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "是思念配偶的恋曲，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "it was a love song longing for a spouse,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "名叫念夫恋，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "called Nenbu Koi,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "不胜欣喜。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I was overcome with joy.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "后来，局依然留在庵中，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Afterward, Lady Kogo still remained in her hermitage,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "为高仓帝的亡灵祈祷冥福，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "praying for the repose of Emperor Takakura's departed spirit,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00654",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "度过了她的后半生。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and there she spent the latter half of her life.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
